# Used by `npm run dev` (Vite's development mode): the portal talks to the
# LOCAL Supabase stack from hyrax-supabase (`supabase start`), never to
# production. Overrides only these two values; everything else (Google
# Picker keys...) still comes from .env.
#
# These are the local stack's built-in defaults, identical on every machine
# and useless against production -- safe to commit. Production values live in
# .env (git-ignored). To run the dev server against production on purpose:
# `npm run dev:prod`.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
